Chapter: Bench Gcd
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Foreword chapter MathLib

Section: Definitions

  my-gcd : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  my-gcd (a) (b) = if b == 0 then a else my-gcd b (math-mod a b)

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (my-gcd 46368 28657))
  end

